# An ON conjunct over a derived table's bare output column moves INTO the body (planner.md §3.2's
# body form); a(3) and a(4) are still NULL-extended.
# cost: 30
query II nosort
SELECT a.id, d.id FROM a LEFT JOIN (SELECT id, k, w FROM b) d ON a.k = d.k AND d.w > 4 ORDER BY a.id, d.id
----
1
11
2
13
